// Delivery events naming an owner key nothing handles.
// With foreign deployments already filtered at translation, any occurrence is a composition bug:
// an owner minted correlations but registered no handler.
// The owner dimension is the literal "unknown" here by design — the key that actually arrived is in
// the accompanying EmailLog.UnknownOwnerKey trace, where cardinality costs nothing.
customMetrics
| where name == "tellma.email.delivery.events"
| extend routing = tostring(customDimensions["email.event.routing"])
| extend transport = tostring(customDimensions["email.transport"])
| where routing == "unknown_owner"
| summarize events = sum(valueSum) by transport, bin(timestamp, 15m)
| where events > 0
